  "description": "Gyeon-Wu, who worked hard plowing the fields of the heavenly world, meets Jiknyeo, who came out for a walk, and falls in love. They fall for her charms and get married in just one year. Gyeon-Wu sucked Jiknyeo every single day with incredible energy. Tired of the physical pain from sex and the mental pain of not being able to do the work of plowing the fields that he loved so much, he decides to get a divorce. But will this divorce be possible?!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\nNote: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.",
